If you love great-value home-style American dining, Ruby Tuesday’s new Hong Kong Mobile App has what you need, and even more for members!

A new look, packed with new features, the New App is more stable and reliable.

**NEW** Remote Menu Ordering for Take-Away

App Features:
- Membership Benefits;
- Exclusive Virtual Members Offers;
- The Latest Menus With the Option to Save Your Favorite Menu Items;
- Maps and Directions to Make Finding Us Easy;
- The Very Latest Ruby Tuesday News and Offers;
